{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to Twisted Gallery \u2014 where reality distorts in silence.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself alone in a modern art museum. White walls, black floors, and meticulously arranged exhibits. Everything seems orderly\u2026 yet deeply unsettling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task is simple: <u>observe and make the right decisions.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Sometimes, moving deeper into discomfort may reveal something different.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you spot the changes? Or will you remain forever trapped in the familiar?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A psychological horror game inspired by <i>The Exit 8</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive first-person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anomalies do not repeat until all have been encountered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden Easter egg anomalies waiting to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Autosave system with the ability to pause at any time</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're free to livestream or upload videos of the game as long as you mention the game's title and platform in your content or description \u2014 no need to contact the developer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If possible, we\u2019d greatly appreciate it if you also include a link to this Steam store page in your content. Thank you so much!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426920?t=1751458274","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426920/295f310fc2750b1090e53077344deb433caa9b2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751458274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor